{"id":"to3wf4dcwmhc0vvp93ugu9qoj","title":"某金融团队分析PostgreSQL TOAST系统性能问题及优化方案","originalTitle":"Burnt TOAST","summary":"某金融团队通过实验对比发现，合理利用PostgreSQL TOAST机制可将表体积压缩超9倍，同时优化压缩算法可提升30倍压缩速度。具体包括：1）创建独立数据表分离大字段 2）利用视图实现查询优化 3）对比pglz与lz4压缩算法性能差异。实验数据显示，在100k行测试中lz4压缩速度比pglz快30倍，但pglz在数据量小于1KB时表现更优。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"Lobsters 热榜"},"links":{"original":"https://www.pgedge.com/blog/burnt-toast"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-04T18:00:32.521Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-05T01:47:59.893Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-05T01:47:59.893Z","category":"data-database","tags":["教程与观点","PostgreSQL"],"score":65,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"96938294-047f-44fe-b97c-6918c6d0f654","title":"某金融团队分析PostgreSQL TOAST系统性能并提出优化方案"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"96938294-047f-44fe-b97c-6918c6d0f654","title":"某金融团队分析PostgreSQL TOAST系统性能并提出优化方案"}],"topics":[{"slug":"postgresql","name":"PostgreSQL"},{"slug":"database","name":"数据库与存储"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fmC5HwmuBJdU","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}